---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Shipping — PeptideLab">
  <section class="max-w-3xl">
    <p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-cyan-400">Support</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-zinc-50">Shipping & Delivery</h1>
    <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-base leading-relaxed text-zinc-400">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">Processing time</h2>
      <p>
        Orders are processed and dispatched within 1&ndash;2 business days of payment confirmation.
        You will receive a confirmation email with your order details once your order ships.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">Delivery times</h2>
      <p>
        Standard shipping typically arrives within 5&ndash;10 business days depending on your location.
        Tracking information is provided for all orders.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">Tracking</h2>
      <p>
        Once your order is dispatched, a tracking number is emailed to you. You can use this number to
        follow your package through the carrier's tracking portal.
      </p>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-zinc-100">Reshipment policy</h2>
      <p>
        If a package is lost in transit or returned to us undelivered, we will reship the order at no
        additional cost. Please contact our support team within 30 days of dispatch to arrange a
        reshipment.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
